<title>POLAND: Mostostal-E group 1996 net at PLN 42 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-E group 1996 net at PLN 42 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Export group results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						    1997	   1996</p>
<p> Group operating profit		     8.73   vs    10,65</p>
<p> Group pre-tax profit			34.72   vs    40.38</p>
<p> Group net profit			    42.05   vs    34.49</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostastal Export SA.</p>
<p>@</p>
<p> Group net sales			    494.79   vs   316.33</p>
<p> Group costs of sales		     413.72   vs   260.87</p>
<p> Group extraordinary profit		 3.31   vs     0.27 loss</p>
<p> Group income tax			     6.97   vs     5.27</p>
<p> Group other taxes			    0.03   vs     0.18</p>
<p> Group financial revenues		  37.69   vs    38.26</p>
<p> Group financial costs		     31.65   vs    20.62</p>
<p> Group investment			    52.33   vs    66.50</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
